Observed:
    int: short_result 6
    int: parts_result 16
    int: to_x 0
    int: change_local 17
    int: relay_local 1
end: Observed
To:
    int: x 0
    Relay: (:= x (x + 1)) (:= (Observed \ relay_local) x)
end: To
From:
    int: x 6
    Change: (:= x (x + 1)) (:= (Observed \ change_local) x) To\Relay()
end: From
FromParts:
    int: x 16
    Change: (:= x (x + 1)) (:= (Observed \ change_local) x) To\Relay()
end: FromParts
Main: From\Change() FromParts\Change() (:= (Observed \ short_result) (From \ x)) (:= (Observed \ parts_result) (FromParts \ x)) (:= (Observed \ to_x) (To \ x))
